[I] Unofficial fork of Bauer stereophonic-to-binaural DSP library

[T] libbs2b is a fork of the Bauer stereophonic-to-binaural DSP (bs2b)
[T] library, designed to improve headphone listening of stereo audio
[T] recordings. It applies a crossfeed filter that simulates loudspeaker
[T] listening and reduces listening fatigue.

[U] https://github.com/alexmarsev/libbs2b

